{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119431","id":3673229692,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7a8Ql8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119431","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119431.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119431.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119431","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119431/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119431/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119431/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1337b7a4b34c381ce62b2bd81737dbfa9fe1f7d1","number":119431,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Propagate inherited base properies to consumer scenes","user":{"login":"SamInTheShell","id":178101099,"node_id":"U_kgDOCp2baw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178101099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell","html_url":"https://github.com/SamInTheShell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamInTheShell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nIf the user updates properties of a base scene or inherited scene, any scenes referencing the inherited scene do not reflect the changes until closed and re-opened.\r\n\r\n**Steps to Replicate**\r\n\r\nI create main.tscn.\r\nmain.tscn is empty.\r\n\r\nI create base.tscn.\r\nI add base.gd to the root node of base.tscn.\r\n\r\nContents of base.gd is:\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\n@export var my_number : int = 50\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the file system explorer, I right click base.tscn.\r\nI choose \"New Inherited Scene\".\r\nI immediately save this new scene as inherited.tscn.\r\n\r\nNow I have main.tscn, base.tscn, and inherited.tscn open still. \r\n\r\nI add inherited.tscn under the root of main.tscn.\r\n\r\nI saved all the open scenes.\r\n\r\nNow I'm watching the inspector for inherited.tscn inside of main.tscn.\r\n\r\nI update the value of my_number in the inspector of base.tscn (not in the code).\r\nI save the updated base.tscn.\r\nI check inherited.tscn's inspector, it has the new value.\r\nI chec main.tscn, it still displays 50.\r\n\r\nBut wait, there's more. \r\n\r\nI close main.tscn. \r\nI open main.tscn.\r\n\r\nThe value is now up to date! \r\n\r\nThat value should have propagated out to all open scenes.\r\n\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/43032\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n**AI Disclosure**, I used Claude Opus 4.7 to perform the investigation, devise a plan for a fix, and implement the fix.\r\n\r\nI did it in one prompt using Claude Code CLI.\r\nThis is literally the prompt I used:\r\n```\r\nThis code base is the Godot Engine.\r\nI need you to fix a bug for me.\r\nI will handle all building and validation of your work.\r\n\r\nGodot has a bug with propagating out inherited scene values.\r\n\r\nI create main.tscn.\r\nmain.tscn is empty.\r\n\r\nI create base.tscn.\r\nI add base.gd to the root node of base.tscn.\r\n\r\nContents of base.gd is:\r\n\\```gdscript\r\nextends Node3D\r\n\r\n@export var my_number : int = 50\r\n\\```\r\n\r\nIn the file system explorer, I right click base.tscn.\r\nI choose \"New Inherited Scene\".\r\nI immediately save this new scene as inherited.tscn.\r\n\r\nNow I have main.tscn, base.tscn, and inherited.tscn open still. \r\n\r\nI add inherited.tscn under the root of main.tscn.\r\n\r\nI saved all the open scenes.\r\n\r\nNow I'm watching the inspector for inherited.tscn inside of main.tscn.\r\n\r\nI update the value of my_number in the inspector of base.tscn (not in the code).\r\nI save the updated base.tscn.\r\nI check inherited.tscn's inspector, it has the new value.\r\nI chec main.tscn, it still displays 50.\r\n\r\nBut wait, there's more. \r\n\r\nI close main.tscn. \r\nI open main.tscn.\r\n\r\nThe value is now up to date! \r\n\r\nThat value should have propagated out to all open scenes.\r\n\r\nPlease do a code review and ensure that these values are propogating out, for all scenes.\r\nWe could have deeply nested inherited scenes... should propagate for all non-modified values in the chain.\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-13T03:28:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T01:11:38Z","closed_at":"2026-05-13T08:20:29Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6cc0cae56e866210078f7c8278ac417d740b6669","assignee":null,"assign